{"id":"garage","lemma":"Garage","pos":"noun","rank":2131,"glosses":["garage (building used to store cars, tools, etc.)","car park, parking garage (building, often with multiple storeys, for vehicles to park in)"],"ipa":"/ɡaˈʁaːʒə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/06/De-Garage.ogg/De-Garage.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Garage","plural":"Garagen"},"examples":[{"text":"Hast du eine Garage?","en":"Do you have a garage?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Das Auto ist in der Garage.","en":"The car is in the garage.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Garage war leer.","en":"The garage was empty.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"empty"}]},{"text":"Deine Garage brennt.","en":"Your garage is on fire.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760595","words":[{"g":"your","l":"dein"},null,{"g":"to burn","l":"brennen"}]},{"text":"Der Wagen steht vor der Garage.","en":"The car is in front of the garage.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"a car"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}